  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The distance between planet X and planet Y is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. A meteorite of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is located on the line connecting the centres of the planets and it is at the same distance from the centres of the planets. The mass of planet X is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> and the mass of planet Y is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2M\"></span>. What is the magnitude of the gravitational force experienced by the meteorite?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GMm}{R^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2GMm}{R^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4GMm}{R^{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5GMm}{R^{2}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
